{
  "title": "Kicked Spicy Kenyan Lamb Kebabs",
  "description": "A spicy and comforting Kenyan dish featuring lamb, fennel, and a Mediterranean twist, grilled to perfection on a binchotan grill.",
  "cuisine": "Kenyan",
